OL,3,ARussell Brand arrives at court for
OL,4,Astart of rape trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand has arrived at court for
OL,7,Fthe start of his rape and sexual
OL,8,Fassault trial.
OL,10,FThe 51-year-old comedian and actor is
OL,11,Ffacing several charges of rape and
OL,12,Fsexual assault against six women, which
OL,13,Fare alleged to have occurred between
OL,14,F1999 and 2009.
OL,16,FThe trial at Southwark Crown Court,
OL,17,Fwhich could last up to 10 weeks, is
OL,18,Fexpected to begin with the process of
OL,19,Fjury selection on Monday morning.
OL,21,FBrand pleaded not guilty to the charges
OL,22,Fduring pre-trial hearings.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
